{"candidate_identity":"ccaa8fd3fdde7d610a06a0d123750f11771eb7f383697da025e9f8b91992120e","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5a0a023b6e96ead2ff8e787b456fa8c8ec84c32786c945a2ef516599511dc441","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"75dcd07c45a8663b299d8fd3ca409a922182a748f72e829961f5cbb4fedfebe2","logical_entry_identity":"9b5b486ee5d1a9f12b76373b1d954398d4d8624ab3e306d5ad14437068ff72c7","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"Your Nihil unravels the existence of the target, tearing them apart with entropy.\n\t\tIf 6 negative magical effects are applied before Nihil expires a Herald of Oblivion will be summoned to assist you for %d turns.\n\t\tCurrently existing debuffs, Spellshocked, and Seen by Arcane Eye will not count towards this total.  Refreshing the same debuff is counted.\n\t\tThe Herald will have a bonus to all attributes equal to your Magic.  Many other stats will scale with level.\n\t\tYour increased damage, damage penetration, critical strike chance, and critical strike multiplier stats will all be inherited.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你的空无能解构目标的存在并通过熵能将其撕裂。\n\t\t在空无效果结束之前，如果目标身上被施加了 6 个负面魔法效果，将召唤出持续 %d 回合的破灭之兆。\n\t\t之前已有的负面效果、法术冲击、被奥术之眼观察不会计入总数。刷新同一个效果会计入总数。\n\t\t破灭之兆的全部属性点提升你魔法属性的相同数值。其他属性根据本身等级提升。\n\t\t破灭之兆会继承你的伤害加成、伤害穿透、暴击几率和暴击倍率加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c7e3de2309af98d0f8c8bb99faa8f57fa44b0ac5dc654c8f463d984cf775df8e","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"75e2b230a61d143ed73477bc824cfaa8f44f8d225bbbddac13f50e90a066665e","logical_entry_identity":"84051befdbecf239b82b5196c32805e4030b7eda2ca4c46829ff64411da21f73","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"nether","source_tag":"talent type","target":"彼世"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bfb3b3f279c320f1dde0432ab21ce3aa5497f853b868449b5d1226e37e5534b8","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"7602fdcf6bea07f77290f0e0462c3e7c4722100d4c85591a6128aa9335697a65","logical_entry_identity":"0798e890731f712d4d86abbb4ba6d0dbbd7d3a6c62e0007c5ecc445dbf5d23b6","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"The font of sacrifice allows you to spend gold to reroll specific parts of a random artifact or rare item (you must first unequip it).\nEach reroll costs #GOLD#500 gold#LAST# for a lesser ego and #GOLD#1000 gold#LAST# for a greater ego per each time you've rerolled that ego type on the same object.\nLesser and Greater egos can only be rerolled into the same type, and only egos with compatible power sources will be offered.\n\nNote:  Many egos and external talents don't currently display properly but will apply to the item correctly.","source_tag":"_t","target":"牺牲之泉允许你花费金币来重置随机神器或稀有物品的部分属性（你必须先脱掉装备）。\n重置价格与重置次数有关，重置一个低级词缀，每重置一次多花费#GOLD#500 金币#LAST#，高级词缀每次多花费#GOLD#1000 金币#LAST#。\n低级词缀只能重置成低级词缀，高级词缀只能重置成高级词缀，只有力量来源相符的词缀才会被选中。\n\n请注意：许多词缀和额外技能在这里不会正常显示，但是它们会正确地加在物品上。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"07b434aa345361ced4010b0cec2a7e3bf7a75cd420eceaabb1300e7bd0d8296a","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"76394653b88ead11d7c45a866d0c84b16cb52d989d13ad1fb8693f239070588b","logical_entry_identity":"a247c819b01de32f54484ef9ab70f689299d925ec2c94c78052f56faf0cf5bd7","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"Grey Area","source_tag":"_t","target":"灰色区域"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4d0c1c169989f6c3f92e53c67e94b38fc871835075f1e8287fafec41e230e2b6","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"764dc5d1b0378f4dd42512968bc115474e04e9f6621c0a8e1a67c7069746e040","logical_entry_identity":"43b8f9247ff8afc3f81c0c36b23c7cdd038f7c7084e2b848c44ba874785883a5","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"You have discovered the entrance to a strange castle inside a huge book. The place seems to eat at your sanity but you feel drawn to it somehow...","source_tag":"_t","target":"你在巨大的书本中发现了通向奇怪城堡的入口。入口似乎在吞噬你的理智，但你感觉自己被它吸引……"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bf9f6a603e64194febfe3a7015e1f6731df92a38c2b8d8c30abac697e3f26fbb","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity"